{"id":"re_action","lemma":"réaction","pos":"noun","rank":1613,"glosses":["reaction (action in response to an event)","reaction","reaction (reactionary politics; a period in which reactionary thought or politics is resurgent or dominant)"],"ipa":"/ʁe.ak.sjɔ̃/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/4/4a/Fr-r%C3%A9action.ogg/Fr-r%C3%A9action.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"réactions"},"formAudio":{"réactions":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/5/52/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Eihel-r%C3%A9actions.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Je voulais juste voir ta réaction.","en":"I just wanted to see your reaction.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to want, wish, desire","l":"vouloir"},{"g":"fair, just"},{"g":"to see"},{"g":"your"},null]},{"text":"Merci pour les réactions.","en":"Thanks for the feedback.","words":[{"g":"thank you"},{"g":"for"},{"g":"the / them","l":"le"},null]},{"text":"Les réactions ont été bonnes.","en":"The feedback was good.","words":[{"g":"the / them","l":"le"},null,{"g":"to have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"summer"},{"g":"good","l":"bon"}]},{"text":"J'apprécie vos réactions.","en":"I appreciate your feedback.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to appreciate","l":"apprécier"},{"g":"your, belonging to you","l":"votre"},null]},{"text":"J'ai eu une réaction similaire.","en":"I had a similar reaction.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"to have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"similar"}]}]}